---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy — NeoMBSE" description="The NeoMBSE privacy notice for site visitors and directory submissions.">
  <article class="section container narrow prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="lead">This is a plain-language starter policy for the pre-launch site. It must be reviewed when analytics, advertising, forms, or other third-party services are enabled.</p>
    <h2>Current site behavior</h2>
    <p>The initial static site does not create user accounts or maintain a visitor database. Directory filtering runs locally in the visitor’s browser.</p>
    <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
    <p>The hosting provider may process basic request information, such as IP address, browser details, and requested pages, for security and service operation.</p>
    <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>No advertising or audience measurement script is included in the starter build. This notice and the consent experience will be updated before either is enabled.</p>
    <h2>Submissions</h2>
    <p>If you send a correction or tool submission by email, the message and contact details will be used to review the submission and communicate about it.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>A public project email address will be added before launch.</p>
    <p><em>Last updated: October 22, 2026.</em></p>
  </article>
</MainLayout>
